aiproof (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Strip trailing AI sign-off chatter ("Is there anything else I can help
    you with?", "Hope this helps!", …) from model responses. Phrases that
    are part of the user's own text are never removed.
  * New: Files (Nautilus) right-click integration — Scripts → "Proofread
    with AI" proofreads selected text files in place (backup kept as
    *.orig). Installed per-user by 'aiproof setup'.

